WEBVTT

1
00:00.400 --> 00:08.007
In C# your program starts by itself. JavaScript in the browser always belongs to an HTML page.

2
00:08.007 --> 00:09.864
In the head we add a script element.

3
00:09.864 --> 00:14.569
The src attribute points to the file script.js in the js folder.

4
00:14.569 --> 00:18.609
With type="module" the file becomes a JavaScript module.
